                    "type": "boolean",
                    "required": false,
                    "help": "Uses eSewa UAT (rc-epay.esewa.com.np); no real money moves. Not available in production. \"Test connection\" books an unpaid Rs 10 eSewa session (in live mode too), which expires on its own.",
